// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2794911269" "Interrupt me when I'm shopping?  I don't think so!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1104251682" "I don't think the boss would appreciate you trying to get in my business, punk."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P243395645" "You clearly ain't learned the rules yet.  No one interrupts me."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P290669445" "Couldn't wait your turn, could you?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1241744139" "How you doin'?  Pretty bad in about a second, I'll bet!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2561492891" "You got some nerve, meat!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_HELLIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2146776814" "Shopping can wait.  Waste 'em!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_HELLIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P961900183" "Find another spot to stink up!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_HELLIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2544058882" "Oh, you did NOT just enter my personal space."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_HELLIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P900533463" "Time to put some fire under you!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_HELLIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2912777177" "That's the problem with meat these days.  They have no respect for lines."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_SNAKES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1623776069" "SSSSuch a mistake."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_SNAKES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1974896725" "SSSStep right up!  For ssssale!  One broken nose!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_SNAKES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2647268725" "The docks aren't big enough for the both of ussss."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_SNAKES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3336013356" "Let me show you how nassssty my bite can be!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOPPER_SNAKES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2736257018" "Fresh meat, perfect for dinner!"

// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1717970894" "It's a hot market.  Place your bet now and we can talk about dividends later."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2085468638" "I'm tellin' ya, he's your best bet for a high return."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1994986777" "I'm tellin' ya, she's your best bet for a high return."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1764957567" "Make the bet, I'm in a rush here."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1324129354" "You wait too long, pal, and the fight'll be over."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1718082056" "As surprising as it sounds, I don't have all day."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P864433680" "Now's the time to make your mark."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3972286364" "Don't get all cheap on me now."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3100370063" "Are you going to stand there twiddling your thumbs or place a bet?"
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P247133310" "Time is money and you're overdrawn.  Place the bet!"
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2287398149" "Indecisive doesn't even cut it.  I've grown gray hairs waiting on you."

// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2056031528" "Don't rush me.  I'm new to this."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3232682335" "So many choices, I don't know who to bet on."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1017846831" "Shhh, keep it down.  My wife doesn't know I'm here."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3017735865" "The boss says bet on the best."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P992968388" "I want in, I just don't know what I want."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3418048300" "You sure?  The best?"
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P208171284" "I've never placed bets before.  Got any suggestions?"
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P522574473" "Hmm..."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2352971301" "Let me think..."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1422794523" "I can't afford to make a mistake."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P683354396" "Do you take checks?"
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P347065346" "Shhh, I'm thinking."
// OAKES_ARENA_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3470739549" "Just a few more minutes.  I'm thinking."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ARMWRESTLE_SPECTATOR_TEXT :
"P126104891" "My sister wrestles better than that!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ARMWRESTLE_SPECTATOR_TEXT :
"P308206737" "Put your weight into it, he's beating you!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ARMWRESTLE_SPECTATOR_TEXT :
"P932097614" "Go!  Go!  Go!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ARMWRESTLE_SPECTATOR_TEXT :
"P1978964465" "Waste him!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ARMWRESTLE_SPECTATOR_TEXT :
"P3738577888" "This table needs spikes.  Extra incentive not to lose."

// OAKES_ARENA_BOOKIE_TEXT :
"P3471762135" "All right, all right.  I can only write so fast."
// OAKES_ARENA_BOOKIE_TEXT :
"P687182103" "You, in the back, what's your bet?"
// OAKES_ARENA_BOOKIE_TEXT :
"P440778927" "Am I lookin' at you?  Then it ain't your turn."
// OAKES_ARENA_BOOKIE_TEXT :
"P2599626977" "Got it.  Sixty bucks.  Next?"
// OAKES_ARENA_BOOKIE_TEXT :
"P291435514" "Freakin' vultures.  Wait your turn, buddy!"
// OAKES_ARENA_BOOKIE_TEXT :
"P1846146067" "Nah, it still ain't your turn, pal.  Next!"
// OAKES_ARENA_BOOKIE_TEXT :
"P3331366132" "Is it your turn yet?  No.  Next!"
// OAKES_ARENA_BOOKIE_TEXT :
"P665231492" "Yes, as a matter of fact, I am ignoring you.  Next bet!"
// OAKES_ARENA_BOOKIE_TEXT :
"P4125511465" "Hey, see that Arbiter drone over there?  You better keep your nose clean.  It'll take you out."

// OAKES_ARENA_BOUNCER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1782944708" "Good luck.  You'll need it."
// OAKES_ARENA_BOUNCER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3797337401" "You sure this is where you wanna be?  You look like a peach to me."
// OAKES_ARENA_BOUNCER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3645049282" "Oh.  Yeah.  You're dead."
// OAKES_ARENA_BOUNCER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3852863595" "Any trouble in there and you are in a world of hurt."
// OAKES_ARENA_BOUNCER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2328640038" "I love this job.  Way better than anger management classes."

// OAKES_CAROUSING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3435024464" "Beat it, bub.  You're cramping my style."
// OAKES_CAROUSING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2971041424" "I have a broken bottle with your name on it."
// OAKES_CAROUSING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4061499501" "Hey, lightweight, the soda fountain's down the street."
// OAKES_CAROUSING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2629007321" "Pretty far from Villa Montrose, aren't you?"
// OAKES_CAROUSING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4252406885" "I'll be checking on you later.  Right now, I'm busy."
// OAKES_CAROUSING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2286761074" "We'll meet again.  It's a promise."
// OAKES_CAROUSING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2431401553" "Gawk much?"

// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_TEXT :
"P840341679" "See this gun?  It says I have the floor."
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_TEXT :
"P176425737" "You really don't want to make me mad."
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_TEXT :
"P4217383927" "Just give me a reason to use this."
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_TEXT :
"P3445517759" "If you don't knock it off, my finger may twitch."
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_TEXT :
"P2758315242" "You got some nerve giving attitude with a gun in your face."
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_TEXT :
"P3755615340" "Zip it!  If I have to talk to you again, I'm going to aerate your skull."
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_TEXT :
"P1551959494" "What do you think?  Should I just shoot him?"
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_TEXT :
"P4079902406" "No fighting near the Arena.  See that Arbiter drone over there? It will take you OUT."

// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_TEXT :
"P1006664977" "Okay, okay, take it easy."
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_TEXT :
"P1742781863" "Look, don't shoot.  A minor disagreement."
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_TEXT :
"P901180119" "I was just--"
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_TEXT :
"P2747172012" "I didn't do nothing."
// OAKES_ARENA_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_TEXT :
"P849346983" "What?  He started it.  Ok!  Take it easy with that thing."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FISHERMAN_TEXT :
"P3355425127" "Bah, how long have I been here?  I never catch anything."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FISHERMAN_TEXT :
"P1425765402" "It's aboot time for a trip to the pub."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FISHERMAN_TEXT :
"P3423733715" "My leg aches.  Blasted, goldfish."

// OAKES_FISHERMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2150748416" "How's it goin', eh?  I'd shake your hand, but the fishing's good!"
// OAKES_FISHERMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3053944964" "Take off, hoser.  This spot is mine."
// OAKES_FISHERMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1137992183" "The fishing's better back home."
// OAKES_FISHERMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1838861968" "Every meal is fish.  I could go for a Nanaimo Bar."
// OAKES_FISHERMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3589770194" "Fish, fish, fish.  I could go for a butter tart."
// OAKES_FISHERMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3299221681" "It's a-boot time for a trip to the pub."
// OAKES_FISHERMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1055276264" "I forgot my fishing rod."
// OAKES_FISHERMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3919845816" "How did I forget my fishing rod?"
// OAKES_FISHERMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3918766908" "Did I leave my fishing rod at the pub?"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P963241901" "All this and brains, too!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1033805224" "What a lovely night for a bit of fun."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2012575330" "Let's get the party started."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2534986840" "Good evening."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2112060071" "Hello there."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2018118665" "Psst.  Over here."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_A_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2701138045" "Uhm.  I don't think so."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_A_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2453741604" "Weren't you here bothering me last week?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_A_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3569333132" "Oh, I don't think so."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_A_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2960012670" "You're invading my personal space.  Go away."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2252305110" "You will never meet another woman like me."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1854246831" "Who loves you, honey?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4204137818" "And how is your evening?  Want to make it better?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P527184459" "Let's have some fun."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_B_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2215553532" "Oh.  It's you.  Yeah, I'm not interested."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_B_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1480368018" "I'm not your girl.  No seriously.  Go find someone else."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_B_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1599910773" "I suddenly have a headache."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_B_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3720541762" "I'm on break."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FLIRT_B_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1688240491" "What?  Quit bothering me."

