// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SALESWOMAN_TEXT :
"P3731735757" "Come check out the Arena!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SALESWOMAN_TEXT :
"P2859127000" "Test your skills!  Who's the best?  Go to the Arena to find out!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SALESWOMAN_TEXT :
