"P2574001921" "Best prices in Dockside!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P1691951118" "Your one-stop shop for nothing in particular!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1337785192" "All I'm saying, dear, is I think you need to spend more time at home."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2836697994" "Honey, you're not listening to me."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P741897084" "Taking over the world can wait.  We have bridge this weekend."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2159239559" "We don't talk enough.  My friend thinks we should communicate more."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P146394248" "You could help me, you know.  We never spend any quality time together."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2597897475" "Honey?  Are you even listening to me?"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2501919914" "It's like I'm talking to a wall with you sometimes."

// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_WIFE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P927573169" "Fine.  Go.  Don't be late for dinner!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_WIFE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3030044112" "I see how it is.  Work always comes first!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_WIFE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1574319210" "I'm not going to stand by while you put work first!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3531013853" "Mmmm hmm..."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2639294585" "You're right, honey."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4131810926" "Really?  I'll have to think on that."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2013546125" "We'll see..."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1690043228" "Of course, dear..."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3706760212" "You're right, dear."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1972478114" "Yes, dear."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3699032168" "Uh huh..."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3597603028" "I was listening to you.  It's just that I have things on my mind."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3188549678" "That's interesting, dear."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1786225838" "I heard you."

// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1333785765" "Hang on, honey.  I need to take care of this."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2208251176" "Later, dear, I have fish to fry!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3656520993" "Gotta go.  Love you, baby."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4160723325" "You got some nerve interrupting me here, meat."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_GARDENING_HUSBAND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3052512850" "Daddy's got to go to work, baby!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1587841738" "I'm bored.  Nothing exciting ever happens around here."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4019946172" "Why did you drag me out here?  This place doesn't even have a mall."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1221523271" "We never go out anymore."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4039126730" "Are you listening to me?"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2919500124" "I think we need to talk more."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2772468190" "What's on your mind, honey?"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P873387317" "Would you like to catch a picture at the cinema later?"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P114267354" "Let's meet up with friends for appetizers later."

// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P578517506" "I'll see you at home, dear."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1386018804" "Pick up some tomatoes when you're done.  I'm making sauce."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3490729870" "Here we go again. I was trying to relax."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_WIFE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3131583500" "Always with the interruptions.  I'll not stand for it!  I'm going to my mother's!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1950525978" "Mm hm.  Yeah.  I'm on top of that."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P308466931" "Got it.  Consider it done."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4192341829" "Right.  We took him out.  He got too curious."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4046339631" "Yeah.  I dealt with him in Dockside.  He's taken care of."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P813458738" "I got it under control.  No need to worry."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2143015807" "He's a friend of mine.  I'll vouch for him."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2301535604" "Yeah, the swag's at the usual place."

// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3462358500" "You just made a mistake."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P858315834" "Montrose doesn't appreciate your presence here."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3985192642" "Go back to 'the Slick', punk."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEISURE_CELLPHONE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P923005870" "Could you not SEE I was on the phone??"

// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P548867714" "This can only end badly."
// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1844743718" "If I were you, I'd turn around and head back to where you came from."
// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2113612983" "Coming here was a BIG mistake.  BIG."
// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P528612905" "I hope you have insurance."
// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1431315335" "This ain't Paragon City, pal.  The rules are...there ain't no rules."
// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P726395134" "What are you looking at?"
// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1182246883" "Today's a good day to die."
// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3090902341" "You're doomed."
// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3233074783" "It's probably going to rain."
// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3107679790" "This place has gone DOWN HILL."
// BLOODYBAY_DOOM_FATALIST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3783384743" "Odds are you're gonna get yourself beat up."

// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1094905075" "Look!  I didn't do anything!"
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P831321059" "I was just following orders!"
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3272214799" "You guys need to calm down before someone gets hurt!"
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3812055978" "I don't know what you're talking about."
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3992334740" "I'm not telling you anything."
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3269922982" "I signed a confidentiality agreement."

// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1032699053" "We know you're holding out!  Tell us what we want to know!"
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P614600823" "If you don't start speaking up about the 'juice' soon, bones will be broken."
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1483899748" "I don't care how important you are, geek.  Tell me what I need to know."
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P465759043" "Either spill the info or we spill your blood."
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2048408855" "That's a pretty white lab coat.  It would be a shame to ruin it."
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1036602764" "I got all day.  You need to start talking."

// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2860267289" "We'll finish this later.  I know where you work!  Problem?"
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2064566437" "You can't keep your research from us.  What do YOU want?"
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4039227216" "We'll deal with you later, geek!"
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1796996939" "Later, geek.  We'll get what we need from you."
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1432765371" "Got a problem?"
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3665593176" "What do YOU want?"
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3619302441" "This isn't any of your business.  Just keep moving."
// BLOODYBAY_MUGSCIENTIST_THREATENER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1795043985" "Nothing to see here.  Keep moving."

// BLOODYBAY_WAITING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2182191114" "It's just a matter of time before we get out of here."
// BLOODYBAY_WAITING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3672446217" "Just be patient.  I'm sure we'll get out of here."
// BLOODYBAY_WAITING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2620910149" "I hate this place.  I gotta get out of here."
// BLOODYBAY_WAITING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1271395922" "We ain't in Paragon City anymore.  Deal with it."
// BLOODYBAY_WAITING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P676893647" "Just stay out of their way and you'll be fine."
// BLOODYBAY_WAITING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P256625638" "It's chaos.  You gotta just stay low and let them fight it out."
// BLOODYBAY_WAITING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1716403028" "If you don't pay attention you'll take it in the back."

// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1856738592" "You hear about the meteors?"
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1507083825" "So what did you hear about the meteors?"
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1705425283" "Something funny is going on around here."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2022311655" "I don't know what's going on.  I just see a lot of techs in lab coats digging around."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3622214324" "There is no way I'm going to that forest.  Whatever's there, I don't need to know about."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P933440857" "This place is a deathtrap."

// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2948140347" "I don't know what's going on with the meteors.  Can I have some of that?"
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4223134807" "You know as much as I do.  Which is nothing."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1833282469" "This place is getting worse.  I should have gotten out of here ages ago."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P674163132" "I don't know anything, man.  You know more than I do."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1370743265" "This place gives me the creeps."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1041402740" "Shhh...someone is coming."

// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WHISPER_A_TEXT :
"P964662045" "Do you think we can get out of here?"
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WHISPER_A_TEXT :
"P3628258246" "This is a hard place."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WHISPER_A_TEXT :
"P1390036646" "We should have left ages ago."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WHISPER_A_TEXT :
"P4026950934" "I'm not cut out for this place."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WHISPER_A_TEXT :
"P355575356" "Shhhh...someone is coming."

// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WHISPER_B_TEXT :
"P100871549" "We need to be careful."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WHISPER_B_TEXT :
"P2023918587" "We'll be fine.  I heard about a way to get back to Paragon."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WHISPER_B_TEXT :
"P2246630161" "Shhhh...not so loud."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WHISPER_B_TEXT :
"P2841989582" "Shh...someone is coming."
// BLOODYBAY_GENERIC_WHISPER_B_TEXT :
"P3514169443" "Just keep your head down and don't react.  You'll be fine."

// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1748078665" "Hm...just let me check one thing here..."
// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3814408688" "You'll be fine.  The unit got you just in time."
// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P600317621" "You're looking a little unsteady.  I'll need to up the medication."
// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3625914064" "You'll be back on patrol in no time."

// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_HEALTHY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2310005955" "So how long until I can return to my unit?"
// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_HEALTHY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P845668533" "Of course, Doctor."
// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_HEALTHY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2318728679" "Yes, Doctor."
// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_HEALTHY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P603347617" "Thank you, Doctor."
// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_HEALTHY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3240522028" "Very good, Doctor."

// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_WOUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2431043583" "I took some heavy fire on a recon run."
// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_WOUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3061220867" "There was a sneak attack on the base.  I'll be fine in a few."
// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_WOUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P166742061" "I feel a little woozy."
// BLOODYBAY_HEROHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_WOUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3059400142" "I'll be right as rain soon, I'm sure."

// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2191459091" "That hit from the heroes is eating up my medical supplies."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2246688208" "Blast!  Getting low on supplies.  I'll need to order more."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1013035166" "Not happy about the casualties.  The heroes will pay."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3052735902" "More gauze.  More bandages.  A few heroes' heads on a platter."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1759182715" "I should send a recon team to the Hero Hospital and swipe some of their supplies."

// BLOODYBAY_HERO_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P2509152679" "Keep a steady supply of meds and scanners.  Check."
// BLOODYBAY_HERO_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P1014665839" "Some heavy casualties today."
// BLOODYBAY_HERO_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P937814686" "Thank goodness.  Light casualties today."
// BLOODYBAY_HERO_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P181354512" "Reminder to self:  more packs."
// BLOODYBAY_HERO_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P1263541033" "I'll need to bring in some more staff for the evening shift."
// BLOODYBAY_HERO_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P2682012743" "I'm getting a little low on bandages.  Better get some more flown in."
// BLOODYBAY_HERO_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P1775525056" "Dratted portable hospital units.  Never enough supplies."

// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1145597396" "Why am I so cold?"
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2097649977" "Great.  I think I feel the flu coming on."
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4183804350" "Anyone got some aspirin?"
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3765056416" "You need that jacket?"
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P692216226" "I'm hungry."

// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P885952830" "I like it here.  It's dirty, but it's quiet."
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1382293237" "Life under the parking lot is one big thunderstorm.  Can't those heroes fight any quieter?"
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4263166071" "I fought in the arena once.  It didn't last long."
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2071246492" "Hey, pal, some day isn't it?"
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3463528367" "This place is going downhill."
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1751537945" "Port Oakes ain't what it used to be."
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P915652445" "Port Oakes is getting better.  Times will improve."
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P916858693" "Just be positive.  Things'll get better."
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2209199524" "Could be worse.  We could be in Siren's Call."
// PORTOAKES_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4236908958" "Could be worse.  We could be in Bloody Bay."

// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3069290207" "You got royally spanked, didn't you?"
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2263832719" "Obviously those martial arts lessons didn't take."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2434175673" "I hope the hero looks as bad as you."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1393180614" "Jeez.  How did the wall fare?"
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2119171430" "Did you even get one hit in before you were sent to the hospital?"
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1641625555" "Let me patch you up quick.  Retribution, my man."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_DOCTORCONSULT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3900980336" "Wow, you look awful."

// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_HEALTHY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2439559420" "You should see the other guy.  I did okay."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_HEALTHY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1676838255" "Hey, they don't call it Bloody Bay for nothing.  Just fix me up."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_HEALTHY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P674080182" "Funny.  I feel fine.  I gotta get back to my unit."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_HEALTHY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3791383940" "Some bedside manner."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_HEALTHY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3291052" "Just fix me up so I can get back to my unit."

// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_WOUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4116554870" "This...is...nothing a few hours...at the pub...can't...handle..."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_WOUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2936624542" "I...feel fine..."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_WOUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1821160898" "World...stop...spinning..."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_WOUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P394387314" "Is this...normal?  I am a bit unsteady."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_WOUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3859818111" "At least I took...ugh...woozy...a few heroes down...with me..."
// BLOODYBAY_VILLAINHOSPITAL_PATIENTCONSULT_WOUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3597208949" "Ooo...spinning...world...fix me up."

// OAKES_ARENA_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3291045739" "I'm going to check the arena up there later, I think."
// OAKES_ARENA_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P538399418" "I used to fight in the arena."
// OAKES_ARENA_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1115965582" "Cold isn't it?"
// OAKES_ARENA_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3175354419" "WHAT a day."

// OAKES_ARENA_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3787507225" "What are we doing later?"
// OAKES_ARENA_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4058255948" "I think I'm going to go for a walk in a few."
// OAKES_ARENA_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1705454561" "So many hours with nothing to do."
// OAKES_ARENA_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P726731720" "We really need to find a new place to hang out."
// OAKES_ARENA_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P879702730" "It's drafty here."

// SIRENSCALL_CLEANUP_CHATTER_A_TEXT :
"P1893696282" "This place looks like a cyclone hit it.  Let's get working."
// SIRENSCALL_CLEANUP_CHATTER_A_TEXT :
"P3142336292" "It feels like I pick up rubble all day and it just NEVER...GOES...AWAY."
// SIRENSCALL_CLEANUP_CHATTER_A_TEXT :
"P447869552" "Come on, people!  This city won't get cleaned up on its own!"
// SIRENSCALL_CLEANUP_CHATTER_A_TEXT :
"P490499261" "Put your backs into it, people!"

// SIRENSCALL_CLEANUP_CHATTER_B_TEXT :
"P3769780684" "I have my own system!  Just let me clean."
// SIRENSCALL_CLEANUP_CHATTER_B_TEXT :
"P4133864730" "I don't think we'll ever get this done."
// SIRENSCALL_CLEANUP_CHATTER_B_TEXT :
"P1172431774" "What do you think of this mess?"
// SIRENSCALL_CLEANUP_CHATTER_B_TEXT :
"P3081502883" "This place is being terrorized by villains!  What a mess!"
// SIRENSCALL_CLEANUP_CHATTER_B_TEXT :
"P2463288237" "We'll never get this cleaned up."

// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2421475822" "What a great shot."
// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3498700577" "I'm the best photographer in the world."
// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3161731145" "Wow, that is something!  Glad I have my camera!"
// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3692366876" "Whoa!  Now THAT's gonna make a headline!"

// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1775197243" "Yeah, you'll never guess where I am.  Siren's Call.  No really!  I am!"
// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1270339446" "This place is trashed.  Seriously!  I'm coming back to Steel."
// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2781301581" "Sure, I'll hold."
// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3416383397" "You would not believe this place.  It's a war zone!"
// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1230707540" "Siren's Call is a battlefield!"

// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P2597875801" "The perfect canvas for my sketchbook."
// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P2497020290" "The ultimate clash of good and evil.  What a great sketch subject."
// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P1328116539" "I'm going to do an entire Siren's Call retrospective art collection."
// SIRENSCALL_NPC_LOOKIELOO_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P840582937" "Ouch.  My finger's cramping up.  I need to quit sketching soon."

// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1721164045" "Okay, well thank you all for coming.  Talos Park has a few issues we need to discuss."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1574078151" "If everyone could please stop talking we could get this meeting started."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1849721670" "Talos Park is in for some trouble.  Those villains are trashing the place!"
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2247988455" "People, people.  I know you have questions and I'll get to them as soon as possible."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4069017406" "Does anyone else want a moment on the soap box?"

// SIRENSCALL_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P2086683807" "Supplies!  We got 'em!  Come and get it!"
// SIRENSCALL_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P973155023" "You!  Over there!  Come over and check out what I have for sale!"
// SIRENSCALL_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P1232903315" "Siren's Call's finest wares!  Right here! Right now!"
// SIRENSCALL_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P334840797" "Come get it while it's hot!  I mean...come and get it!"

// SIRENSCALL_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2176924557" "Some night."
// SIRENSCALL_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P66236152" "Siren's Call is a wasteland.  I think I'm gonna head back to P City."
// SIRENSCALL_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3963102934" "Why are we still here?  There's chaos everywhere."
// SIRENSCALL_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3962983652" "We should really think about moving back to P City."
// SIRENSCALL_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2083137273" "I'm freezing.  Anyone got an extra jacket?"
// SIRENSCALL_GENERIC_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2525596099" "Who's up for marshmallows?"

// GENERIC_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3510389969" "Spare change?"
// GENERIC_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2070387830" "Can you spare some change?"
// GENERIC_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3765871674" "Can you spare some change?  I need to get back to Paragon City.  Lost my Monorail pass."
// GENERIC_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1465217891" "Anything you can spare?"
// GENERIC_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P262262334" "Got a buck?"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_ASSISTANT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P877922151" "Thank you.  You've been very helpful."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_ASSISTANT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4088291232" "Ok, thank you very much."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_ASSISTANT_FCHELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P488022523" "Yes, you'll want to stay close to the roads and not travel too far from Corps patrols."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_ASSISTANT_FCHELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1691232446" "The Crimson Islands are connected by a series of bridges."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_ASSISTANT_FCHELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2062048659" "Of course, it's my pleasure to help."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_ASSISTANT_FCHELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P965093274" "Have a good day, citizen."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_ASSISTANT_FCHELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2314943270" "Wyvern and Legacy Chain are also here to assist you."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_ASSISTANT_FCHELPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P409931166" "Quick!  To safety!  Let me take care of this!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_ASSISTANT_FCHELPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2655734193" "Run!  I'll handle this!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_ASSISTANT_FCHELPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3363043259" "You need to find a safe place.  Quickly now!  I'll handle this!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_BARRELROLL_NPC_TEXT :
"P3241422548" "Sumtimes I fink the only fing I do is push this 'ere barrel."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BARRELROLL_NPC_TEXT :
"P260073256" "Ye best move along or ye'll wind up wif a barrel on yer toes, mate."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BARRELROLL_NPC_TEXT :
"P1641856453" "Oy.  First 'e says to th' warehouse, then 'e says the docks."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BARRELROLL_NPC_TEXT :
"P2392099494" "Oi, me back is achin'."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BARRELROLL_NPC_TEXT :
"P3514911040" "Ten minutes, mate, then yer on a break.  Ten minutes."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_BOUNCER_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3836344955" "You on the list?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BOUNCER_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1037512715" "You're going to wear that?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BOUNCER_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P126127453" "I've seen worse."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BOUNCER_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2713007059" "Oh great.  You again."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BOUNCER_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P480546829" "If even a glass gets chipped, you're on my 'bad' list."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BOUNCER_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3551881177" "And...who might you be?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BOUNCER_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P246371470" "Is there a problem?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BOUNCER_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3742676707" "I'm sorry.  I'm very busy right now.  If you have trouble finding the street..."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BOUNCER_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3656593738" "Stop!  Name?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BOUNCER_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3397525015" "Hey, I got a joke for you.  You're not on the list."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P92725959" "Buy low, sell high.  That's my motto."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P848008839" "You want to make sure to get in while the market is hot."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P2501487521" "With all the turmoil around here, property is a steal.  I'd consider investing."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P2063329126" "Well, going forward, I think we need to think outside the box on this one."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P3204590904" "Hey, I deserve that account.  I have the total package."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P3182355493" "Well, once we have all of our ducks in a row, we can proceed with the next phase of marketing."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P1505203310" "He said he wanted to touch base and go over the briefs this weekend."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2370523736" "I stepped up to the plate and did what it takes to get the job done."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P1679285500" "Top notch.  Let's go to lunch."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P4126566800" "You know, at the end of the day, it's a win-win situation."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P3440105387" "I think Hutchins is the big hitter on this account.  He's our man."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P1681000322" "Well, you need a big hitter who can step outside the box and see the big picture to get the job done."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P1774116855" "So there he was, ranting in the meeting about it.  I told him to take it offline."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1637347858" "Yeah.  I got stranded in Nerva whatchamacallit.  Don't ask me to pronounce it."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P574305251" "Hey, can you meet me at the bistro in ten minutes?  I'm going to be a little late."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P104717282" "I think I'm losing signal here."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P2021793019" "Hello?  Did I hear you correctly?  The shop on the pier?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1779669040" "Hey, can you pick up a gift on your way?  I didn't have time."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_PLAYDICE_WINNER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3605488849" "IIIIIIIII am the champion....my friend..."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PLAYDICE_WINNER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3826856062" "I'm so on a roll!  Ha!  I made a joke!  Get it?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PLAYDICE_WINNER_NPC_TEXT :
"P2150641122" "Pay up, pally.  I win!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PLAYDICE_WINNER_NPC_TEXT :
"P336154132" "You lose!  Ha ha ha ha ha!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_PLAYDICE_LOSER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3695643641" "I hate playing with you."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PLAYDICE_LOSER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3742554617" "You're such a sore winner."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PLAYDICE_LOSER_NPC_TEXT :
"P1059843298" "Last game.  I can't take this kind of aggravation."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PLAYDICE_LOSER_NPC_TEXT :
"P53399217" "They must be loaded.  You can't possibly win 12 games in a row.  That is statistically impossible."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1697020076" "He was home last night.  I am sure of it.  When I went in to wake him up this morning, he was gone!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P779605317" "I have another picture, if that will help."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3837815442" "I don't know what to do!  She was there and then she was gone!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1314707423" "No, if she'd run away she wouldn't have left her purse on the table."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P105504705" "It just happened so fast, I don't know where to start."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2943782274" "They're coming for me now, too!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1527690429" "Ok!  Call me!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2182952719" "Ack!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P649256299" "Don't forget what I said!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_FCHELP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3978066190" "I'm not going to lie to you, it's a possibility she's been kidnapped.  But we'll find her."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_FCHELP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1501782046" "Yes, ma'am.  Can you tell me anything else that you think will help us in finding her?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_FCHELP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P762413130" "Ok, let's take it from the top.  When did you last see him?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_FCHELP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2469016237" "Right.  Ok, go on."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_FCHELP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3527097484" "Take cover.  I'll handle this!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_FCHELP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2384769022" "Get yourself to safety!  I'll take care of this!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_FCHELP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P431966753" "It'll be ok!  Go where I told you and I'll meet you there shortly!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_MISSINGLOVEDONE_FCHELP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P8550760" "Go!  Now!  I'll find you!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSIE_NPC_TEXT :
"P2654583195" "Extra!  Extra!  Read all about it!  Demons in Thorn Isle!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSIE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1438749449" "Extra!  Extra!  Test subjects escape from Crey Research facility!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSIE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3281652087" "Extra!  Extra!  Crime spree tears through Crimson Isles!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSIE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3003315531" "Extra!  Extra!  Get the latest news!  Step right up!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSIE_NPC_TEXT :
"P771344861" "Hey, you!  Come get a paper!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSIE_NPC_TEXT :
"P668257238" "Extra!  Extra!  Lost kidnapping spree in Crimson Isles!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3630329118" "Sigh.  Same story.  Different headline."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P462619839" "Why is it never good news?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3122883949" "Didn't I read this one already?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P2196743234" "Hm..."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P894491213" "Oh dear..."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P2717496939" "Oh my goodness..."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3029402888" "Unbelievable!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3436687762" "Hey, what happened to the comic section?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P1436854477" "Hey, what happened to the sports section?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P1452822097" "Hey, what happened to the entertainment section?"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_TESTSUBJECT_NPC_PAPARAZZI_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P4212644369" "Oh man.  This shot will cement my career."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_TESTSUBJECT_NPC_PAPARAZZI_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2149381124" "Test subjects!  Does it get any better?  I'll be famous!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_TESTSUBJECT_NPC_PAPARAZZI_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2092234431" "I love my job!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_TESTSUBJECT_NPC_PAPARAZZI_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P508708798" "This is so much better than photographing celebrities."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_TESTSUBJECT_NPC_PAPARAZZI_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P202683982" "Now this is real journalism!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_NPC_PHOTOOPCREY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1250762496" "Great.  Just let me get one more picture!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_NPC_PHOTOOPCREY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1745795623" "This is so great.  Another picture?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_NPC_PHOTOOPCREY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P489100124" "You know, you guys are nothing like people say.  Another picture before I go?"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_PHOTOOP_CREYPRGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2415811983" "It would be my pleasure.  Certainly."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_PHOTOOP_CREYPRGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2066155096" "Of course."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_PHOTOOP_CREYPRGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2570372652" "Certainly."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_PHOTOOP_CREYPRGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2750145608" "Crey Industries is cutting edge technology and that frightens some people.  Crey has your best interest at heart."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_PHOTOOP_CREYPRGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4075530206" "Crey is a pioneer company often misunderstood.  Another picture is fine."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_PHOTOOP_CREYPRGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P972515934" "I'd be pleased to personally escort you through a company tour."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_PHOTOOP_CREYPRGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P484404559" "Stand back!  Let me take care of this!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_PHOTOOP_CREYPRGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2670850320" "To safety!  Crey is on top of it!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SENTINEL_PHOTOOP_CREYPRGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2222557255" "Get to safety.  Crey will take care of this!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P695176500" "Wow, you guys are so terrific.  So heroic.  Just another picture?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P430204551" "Can I get an autograph, too?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4249379012" "Have you been hurt on duty?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1839171175" "How did you start with the Corps?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1729726953" "So if I wanted to join...how would I go about doing that?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4237489120" "So...do you get benefits in the Corps?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1087604334" "You have the best job in the world!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3590182205" "Hey, can you fly?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2670529563" "So can you sign an autograph for my son?  He loves you guys."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P769358321" "So can you sign an autograph for my daughter?  She loves you guys."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_FCPOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1525325571" "It's a very rewarding job, definitely."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_FCPOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2723338268" "Well thank you, that's very kind of you to say.  I'd be delighted."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_FCPOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4167550197" "It's a difficult but incredibly rewarding job.  I'm quite happy to be with Freedom Corps."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_FCPOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3161443911" "Quick!  Get to safety!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_FCPOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2024857227" "Run!  Quick!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_FCPOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P869725271" "Let me take care of this!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_WYVERNPOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2635035180" "How's this?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_WYVERNPOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4260818021" "Did you get the picture?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_WYVERNPOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1200518527" "How about this pose?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_WYVERNPOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2630984931" "Sure, kid, take the picture."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_WYVERNPOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P52270355" "Maybe later, kid!  Off you go!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_WYVERNPOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P506502564" "Ok, cutting this short!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_WYVERNPOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2507808332" "Let's do this!  You!  Get inside!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_WYVERNPOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4195029235" "Get out of here before you get hurt!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P3241004425" "Did you see her dress?  Way a bad color."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P3637526307" "So what do you think?  Shopping then a latte?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P2359743784" "He's such a jerk.  He thinks he's Mr. Charming."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P1347877708" "This place is boring.  Same old villains.  It used to be such a thrill.  Now it's just...blah."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P1430446829" "I think I need a new hair style.  This one is so last season."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P1519787982" "Sorry, hon?  I was talking.  What did you say?"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2636941196" "That outfit does nothing for her figure."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P3319677932" "Hey, did you try that lip gloss I got for you?  Isn't it just sublime?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2066224143" "I think I'm going to go for a spa later."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2297634664" "This weather does absolutely nothing for my hair.  Can you say frizz?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_SOCIALITE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P704875586" "I'm sorry.  Did you say something?  I was talking."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P296805364" "This is going to make an excellent addition to my scrapbook."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3898187490" "Wow!  What a shot!  I better get another just in case."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3872149075" "This camera is so clunky.  I wish I had a digital."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P1312880380" "I am a genius photographer!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2791372806" "What a shot!  I could do this for a living!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P880850536" "I can't wait to get home and print these!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P4014382180" "Mm hm.  Nerva.  Yeah, the one with the long name that no one can pronounce."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3004396544" "Right.  I'll be here for a few days then I may head over to Port Oakes.  I have some business there."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3097885057" "I don't know "
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2025612704" "?  Or "
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P237008633" "?  Does it really matter?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1160308538" "No, I'll wait another ten minutes then I'm out of here."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P4030099932" "I'm losing signal.  Can you speak up?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3714410317" "Yeah, my battery is going.  I'm going to have to find a land line."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P155383554" "Aside from everyone trying to kidnap me or rip me off, this place is a great spot for sketching."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P2938140014" "I'm an artistic genius."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P2372730825" "A bit more shading there and...perfect."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P1137604221" "WHAT a masterpiece.  I could sell this in a museum."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P720726637" "Wow I'm good.  I wonder if I'm related to Van Gogh?"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P1093030136" "Step right up!  You want it!  We got it!  Cheap!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P1149603392" "If I don't have it, no one has it!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P1294837356" "Quality goods at affordable prices, people!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P1313092925" "Come and get it while it's ho-- Uh.  Come and purchase my legal procured goods!"

// WE_ARE_PLACEHOLDERS_AND_WILL_BE_REMOVED_AFTER_TESTING :
"P2748224131" "We are placeholders and will be removed after testing."

// OAKES_BASECONTACT_FLAG_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P897458834" "I am here to show you where the portal to the base is."

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_ARACHNOSPORTALTECHNICIAN_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P1573713033" "Hm...interesting markings here.  We must crack the code."
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_ARACHNOSPORTALTECHNICIAN_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P2408675023" "I got it.  Writing it down now."
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_ARACHNOSPORTALTECHNICIAN_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P541263245" "Huh...interesting."

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_ARACHNOSPORTALTECHNICIAN_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2194919514" "This place is crawling with Thorns."
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_ARACHNOSPORTALTECHNICIAN_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P4214531768" "They're ignoring us, keep working."

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1627010231" "Mercy is a hole.  I can't believe I have reception here."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3032696347" "This is not what I expected.  I'm out of here as soon as I can get a ride."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P4051646700" "I had some Arachnos guys shoving me around.  What do you mean you can't make a case?  You're a lawyer!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P2441431348" "This is ridiculous.  They're dropping off Ziggurat prisoners here!  You need to get me out NOW!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3522965959" "No, I will NOT hold!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_CLOCKTOWERCRAZY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1473344428" "I'm not taking it anymore!  You've pushed this guy around for the LAST TIME!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CLOCKTOWERCRAZY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4227390827" "You are going down!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CLOCKTOWERCRAZY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P653139118" "I've had it!  I have HAD IT!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CLOCKTOWERCRAZY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P555116381" "You pushed me around ONE TOO MANY times!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CLOCKTOWERCRAZY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4253482760" "If I go down, I'm taking someone with me!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_DUCKFROMFIRE_TEXT :
"P2564860755" "Gunfire!  Duck!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_DUCKFROMFIRE_TEXT :
"P3891302405" "What the heck was that?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_DUCKFROMFIRE_TEXT :
"P3424319918" "Watch out!  Live rounds!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_DUCKFROMFIRE_TEXT :
"P2097575244" "Hit the ground!  They're shooting!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_DUCKFROMFIRE_TEXT :
"P2568916189" "Gunfire!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_DUCKFROMFIRE_TEXT :
"P845631633" "Someone's shooting!"

// MERCY_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2303822408" "I hate this place."
// MERCY_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3507249995" "I really hate this place."
// MERCY_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3827369382" "I hate this place more than you do."
// MERCY_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1427387687" "I had no idea the Isles would be so rough."
// MERCY_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1859758326" "I'm out of here.  The second I can hitch a transport."
// MERCY_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1003291495" "It's not really cold, but I'm shivering to my bones.   This place gives me the creeps."
// MERCY_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1310506265" "I'm serious.  Just walk around like you don't even see them.  They'll leave you alone."
// MERCY_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1612347586" "Keep your eyes down and keep walking.  That's the key."
// MERCY_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4255183065" "If you show fear, they'll come after you.  Just keep walking."
// MERCY_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3570984576" "It's simple.  Just keep walking.  They'll ignore you."

// MERCY_DARWIN_COINFLIP_TEXT :
"P3356445774" "Your luck is about to run out.  Mine did."
// MERCY_DARWIN_COINFLIP_TEXT :
"P720165793" "If you think you're going to make a mark here, you're right.  Can you say 'splat'?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_COINFLIP_TEXT :
"P2444616051" "Heads you lose.  Tails you lose."
// MERCY_DARWIN_COINFLIP_TEXT :
"P1476707269" "Odds are, pal, you won't make it."

// MERCY_DARWIN_HOSPITAL_GETTINGTREATED_DOCTOR_TEXT :
"P33790390" "Wow, this doesn't look good."
// MERCY_DARWIN_HOSPITAL_GETTINGTREATED_DOCTOR_TEXT :
"P2451711516" "This can't be right."
// MERCY_DARWIN_HOSPITAL_GETTINGTREATED_DOCTOR_TEXT :
"P2737309768" "I have never seen anything like this before."
// MERCY_DARWIN_HOSPITAL_GETTINGTREATED_DOCTOR_TEXT :
"P275427866" "Oh...my...goodness."
// MERCY_DARWIN_HOSPITAL_GETTINGTREATED_DOCTOR_TEXT :
"P171172025" "This is beyond my level of training.  This is SO beyond it."

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPC_LEDGESIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P798640039" "Whoever named this place Mercy Island had a lame sense of humor."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPC_LEDGESIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3988235724" "Maybe we should head over to Port Oakes later.  It can't be as bad as this place."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPC_LEDGESIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3038429147" "I'm tired."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPC_LEDGESIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4023757821" "I'm bored."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPC_LEDGESIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2619244820" "How long have we been sitting here.  I think my lower half just fell asleep."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPC_LEDGESIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1544805966" "See the Infected fighting in those mock battle domes?  Crazy."

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_MOB_PROTEST_TEXT :
"P2641787201" "Just let us back on!  This is so unfair!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_MOB_PROTEST_TEXT :
"P1446079245" "I want to go back to Paragon City!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_MOB_PROTEST_TEXT :
"P2518339816" "This is ridiculous!  You can't treat us this way!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_MOB_PROTEST_TEXT :
"P1160084499" "I will not take this any longer!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_MOB_PROTEST_TEXT :
"P2918504317" "I'm calling my lawyer!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_MOB_PROTEST_TEXT :
"P3294416918" "I just want to leave!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_MOB_PROTEST_TEXT :
"P2491970966" "I want to go back to the Zig!  I was safer there!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_MOB_PROTEST_TEXT :
"P1597852059" "This is ridiculous!  We're not chosen!  Recluse is making this into a blood sport!"

// MERCY_MOVEALONG_ARACHNOSNPC_TEXT :
"P2503672769" "Move along, meat."
// MERCY_MOVEALONG_ARACHNOSNPC_TEXT :
"P4121066202" "Keep moving, meat."
// MERCY_MOVEALONG_ARACHNOSNPC_TEXT :
"P3326692274" "Did I say stop, meat?"
// MERCY_MOVEALONG_ARACHNOSNPC_TEXT :
"P1484240506" "Keep walking."
// MERCY_MOVEALONG_ARACHNOSNPC_TEXT :
"P2588905954" "Just...go."

// MERCY_NEWSIE_NPC_TEXT :
"P2460095144" "Read all about it!  Contaminated drinking water is infecting people!"
// MERCY_NEWSIE_NPC_TEXT :
"P2157532463" "Snakes slithering through the streets of Darwin's Landing!"
// MERCY_NEWSIE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1538177201" "Crazy Guy stalks the Clocktower!"
// MERCY_NEWSIE_NPC_TEXT :
"P2919235393" "The Fort is under siege by Freedom Corps!"

// MERCY_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P350720846" "Oh goodie.  More bad news."
// MERCY_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P945257614" "That's an interesting spin on a lie."
// MERCY_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3856767604" "This doesn't look good.  Where's my cell phone?"
// MERCY_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P4088298621" "Finally.  My stock went up."
// MERCY_NEWSPAPER_NPC_TEXT :
"P841738608" "Mental note.  Stay away from Bloody Bay.  What a blood bath."

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPCSHOVER_TEXT :
"P2632873873" "You get outta my face!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPCSHOVER_TEXT :
"P1837789073" "Get away from me!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPCSHOVER_TEXT :
"P649379652" "Hey, pal, it's like a teeter totter!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPCSHOVER_TEXT :
"P3152442190" "Back and forth he goes!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPCSHOVER_TEXT :
"P1468075376" "Yeah!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPCSHOVER_TEXT :
"P1816772598" "Woo hoo!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPCSHOVER_TEXT :
"P3978594602" "What do you think of THAT?!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_NPCSHOVER_TEXT :
"P758815183" "You push me? I push you back with assistance!"

// MERCY_SPRAYPAINTNPC_TEXT :
"P2413335024" "Don't get caught.  Don't get caught.  Don't get caught."
// MERCY_SPRAYPAINTNPC_TEXT :
"P470933720" "I...am a genius."
// MERCY_SPRAYPAINTNPC_TEXT :
"P1472102526" "No one understands the poignancy of my work."
// MERCY_SPRAYPAINTNPC_TEXT :
"P208251160" "I should get paid for this - it's so good."
// MERCY_SPRAYPAINTNPC_TEXT :
"P3134614983" "Nuts.  Think I ran out of paint."

// BREAKOUT_GUARD_COWERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3452388398" "Please, don't hurt me! I have kids!"
// BREAKOUT_GUARD_COWERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1081851014" "You won't make it out of here alive!"
// BREAKOUT_GUARD_COWERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2160244808" "Help!"

// BREAKOUT_MEDIC_COWERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1931006721" "Please, leave me alone! I'm only here to treat people!"
// BREAKOUT_MEDIC_COWERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2774074552" "No, don't hurt me!"
// BREAKOUT_MEDIC_COWERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2331565124" "Please, take what you want, just go away!"

// BREAKOUT_NPC_POLICE_CAGED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1365824356" "Hey, let me out of here!"
// BREAKOUT_NPC_POLICE_CAGED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P328656350" "I'll break you in half if you don't let me out!"
// BREAKOUT_NPC_POLICE_CAGED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1218320367" "Billy, I told you to leave the nurse alone!"

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_ARTIST_TEXT :
"P3310290714" "I can't believe I'm trying to create beauty in a hole like this."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_ARTIST_TEXT :
"P4265858778" "Pain.  Angst.  Gristle.  This is what I need for my ghetto series."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_ARTIST_TEXT :
"P303174553" "Sketch faster, ace, could get jumped at any minute.  Art is pain, but it better not be mine."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_ARTIST_TEXT :
"P797019891" "This place is deplorable.  I love it!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_FIREBURST_TEXT :
"P829567071" "Pipe down!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_FIREBURST_TEXT :
"P2307594807" "Keep it down!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_FIREBURST_TEXT :
"P4182549148" "Move on out of here!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_FIREBURST_TEXT :
"P4175433846" "Beat it!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_FIREBURST_TEXT :
"P317174568" "Save the drama for your mama!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_FIREBURST_TEXT :
"P4109544729" "Stow it!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_FIREBURST_TEXT :
"P2107095168" "The next fire burst goes into you whiners, not over your heads!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_FIREBURST_TEXT :
"P2089245369" "You're nothing until you PROVE yourself to Lord Recluse.  Until then, all bets are off!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_FIREBURST_TEXT :
"P2311001349" "Move along!  You're just meat until you prove your worth to Lord Recluse!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_WALKIETALKIE_TEXT :
"P3550340696" "Yeah, they're protesting.  No, not yet.  Just shots over their heads."
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_WALKIETALKIE_TEXT :
"P454793180" "Small mob.  Nothing to worry about."
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_WALKIETALKIE_TEXT :
"P156016283" "We haven't started shooting at them...yet."
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_WALKIETALKIE_TEXT :
"P545322458" "Nah, we're under control here.  A few signs.  A few rocks."
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_WALKIETALKIE_TEXT :
"P1605076061" "Sure.  Just over their heads.  Got it."
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_WALKIETALKIE_TEXT :
"P28099609" "They don't realize they're just meat until they prove themselves to Lord Recluse.  No, we won't shoot...yet."
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_WALKIETALKIE_TEXT :
"P3412323563" "If they can't take a little heat, how are they gonna prove themselves to Lord Recluse?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_MOB_WALKIETALKIE_TEXT :
"P1569361148" "Only the strong will survive.  We'll take down the weak ones.  Lord Recluse won't even hear about them."

// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2939001506" "I used to want to be a Superhero.  Now I'd just settle for a bath."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3389302780" "Rotten luck is the only luck I have."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1877821982" "Sometimes I used to sneak up onto the orange PTS pipes.  Fastest way to get around the city."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1683724649" "Those Luddites seem like their hearts are in the right place.  But those outfits..."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3009552987" "Got anymore of those Luddite pamphlets? Many a night those have kept me warm"
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1382525720" "Find a Luddite, get some pamphlets, then shove them inside your shirt.  Perfect insulation."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1857434582" "I hear that those Luddites know stuff about Aeon's power plant. Secret stuff."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2380374961" "Maybe those Luddites got it right.  I always feel really weird when I sleep under the orange PTS pipes."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3896548381" "Maybe I should join up with those Luddites.  They seem like good folk."

// CAP_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2981681320" "Change? Please?  I want to buy a ticket outta here."
// CAP_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1872193480" "Got a dollar?"
// CAP_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4113981459" "Arachnos beat me up and now I can't work no more."
// CAP_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1687515028" "Spare change? Please?"
// CAP_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1837273784" "Spare Change?  I want a hot dog."
// CAP_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1038439313" "Anything you can spare."

// CAP_SLEEP_PARKBENCH :
"P2798586382" "Leave me alone."
// CAP_SLEEP_PARKBENCH :
"P3564952473" "I'm so tired."
// CAP_SLEEP_PARKBENCH :
"P481448316" "Get your own place to sleep."
// CAP_SLEEP_PARKBENCH :
"P2188986463" "I'm not too proud."
// CAP_SLEEP_PARKBENCH :
"P2852869348" "Back off, man."
// CAP_SLEEP_PARKBENCH :
"P4009751824" "What you want?"

// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1362685375" "Aeon's cheap electricity shoulda meant good jobs for all of us."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4039164426" "I wish those fancy buildings up in Aeon City had some sweet dumpsters."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1270965456" "I used to be a banker. Seems like we were getting robbed every day."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3325099724" "You ever see those sparky demons that seem to come out of the power stations?  Crazy."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1042325555" "A burning barrel here or a burning barrel in Paragon city.  I see no difference, frankly."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P78167308" "No lie! It was this giant electric lookin' demon and it was stompin' all around Cap au Diable."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2854500529" "Cap au Diable?  Think it means 'Cape of the Devil.' "
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1236350820" "Mercy Isle was rough.  Port Oakes was rough. Why should Cap au Diable  be any different?"
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2311362643" " 'Leave Paragon city, it will be good for you!' she said. Man, was she wrong."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2981603423" "Judge said the Army or the Rogue Isles.  I sure chose wrong."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3332969504" "I like the idea of a jet pack, but I can't see myself joining up with the Gold Brickers."
// CAP_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2846142304" "You think there is anything under Aeon City? Sure looks like a lot of space under there."

// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P1481892110" "These Aeon City buildings are so tall. Way taller than back in Paragon City."
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3611949382" "Wonder where I can get film around here?"
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2961342307" "I'd ask one of those Gold Brickers to take my picture, but they'd just steal the camera."
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2900197065" "My friends will love these pictures."
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P1567456502" "Aeon City is beautiful, despite all the crime."
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3639018672" "Man these walls are impressive.  Like cosmic radiator fins."

// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P4248888625" "No.  Aeon City is actually really clean."
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2236187661" "Reception is excellent here."
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3228272411" "This place reminds me of the nicer parts of Paragon City."
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2658908048" "Before I retired, I used to work for one of these companies."
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P735000826" "I'll be back in a week"

// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P3247092534" "Wonder where I can get some more sketchpads around here?"
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P4086109939" "I'd ask one of those Gold Brickers to pose for me, but he'd probably mug me."
// CAP_AEON_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P438428410" "My friends will love these paintings."

// CAP_NH_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P436614693" "Those Aeon City buildings are so tall. Way taller than back in Paragon City."
// CAP_NH_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3798427336" "This place is really nice. Who would have thought a gem like this place would be here?"
// CAP_NH_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2349374487" "I love those buttresses.  Going to take a pic."
// CAP_NH_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2731508434" "I like this place."

// CAP_NH_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2763484480" "I'm telling you. New Haven is prime for a real estate boom."
// CAP_NH_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P853910220" "We should get in early on the gentrification of New Haven.  The yuppies are going to fight for condos here."


// CAP_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P1861214800" "Freshest items on the street!"
// CAP_VENDOR_NPC_TEXT :
"P1489438697" "Best prices in Cap au Diable!"

// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P624522779" "I used to work in one of the secret labs here.  We did awful things to those arachnoids."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P533351918" "I'd heard about the secret base down below, but I had always dismissed them as urban myths."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1553034001" "Scary things lurk below here."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3652667372" "Warburg was a nice place, before Marshall Blitz decided to split from Arachnos."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1673101865" "This damn warzone."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P770638235" "I am nervous as a cat, what with all those rocket launches."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3188122465" "No, I think all those heroes are worse.  If they left this place alone it would get quieter."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1112032081" "I say that Blitz was right to go rogue. Recluse did not know what he had cooking down in those labs."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3568101033" "You know what I fear?  Those arachnoids. Supersoldiers only half cooked.  Gotta be insane from all that!"
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3767711616" "I got bit by a brown recluse once. So.. Yeah, spiders freak me out."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2563212878" "The island was once a Council base, then it was Arachnos owned, then it Was Rogue captured.   Now I think those damn heroes want a piece, too."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2140028816" "I'm so tired of this all."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P16093893" "I had a nice place to live, before...the troubles."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2771840468" "...and so there was a big crash in the lab and there were, like ... a hundred Arachnoids running around."
// WARBURG_WARMHANDS_BARREL_CLUSTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2161973777" "I'm going to ask those Longbow guys down south if they'll take me out of here, to Paragon city."


// WARBURG_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3942410466" "Help us."

// WARBURG_SLEEP_PARKBENCH :
"P95192344" "Go away."
// WARBURG_SLEEP_PARKBENCH :
"P2513173995" "There is nothing here for me, anymore."




// VILLAINS_ARCHITECT_PLANS_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P796515901" "This place is gonna be great.  Sure, I cut a few corners..."
// VILLAINS_ARCHITECT_PLANS_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2173143847" "Whatever.  They didn't pay me enough to put in the full details.  If it falls down in five years, I'll be long gone."
// VILLAINS_ARCHITECT_PLANS_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2606427256" "A job's a job.  Just pay me and I'm done.  Quality is always optional."

// VILLAINS_CONSTRUCTION_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2001496307" "We've been on break how long?  Two hours.  That's about right."
// VILLAINS_CONSTRUCTION_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2045316938" "I'm just not fiscally motivated enough to go back to work."
// VILLAINS_CONSTRUCTION_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3644691664" "Have I mentioned how lame this job is?"
// VILLAINS_CONSTRUCTION_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2143304167" "I'm hungry.  When's lunch?  We just had it?"

// VILLAINS_ALLZONES_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P369757168" "I'm telling you.  If you think this place is ANYTHING like Paragon City, you're wrong."
// VILLAINS_ALLZONES_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P272183142" "I had no idea how good I had it in Paragon until I came here."
// VILLAINS_ALLZONES_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1920315591" "If you think I'm moving two INCHES from this spot to come find you, you're dead wrong."

// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1663884211" "I suppose I could replace supplies, but, I can't even see my hand in front of my face in this hole."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P4044701840" "Why...do I even bother?"
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2492050384" "This is a complete waste of my time."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1523825376" "No one's going to restock anything.  Even if they do, it'll get stolen."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1889156434" "This is totally pointless.  I may as well be handing out supplies on the corner."

// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_DOCTOR_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3382759196" "Yeah, I did that once, too.  The lawsuit was unbelievable."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_DOCTOR_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2171361966" "Whatever.  They can't sue who they can't find, y'know?"
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_DOCTOR_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1649177972" "We just have to do enough to get them up and out of here.  That's all."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_DOCTOR_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P4232628267" "This place is a joke.  How can any doctor work in here?  Even a licensed one?  I say we're fine.  Juuust fine."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_DOCTOR_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P74963019" "Hey, you know, beggars can't be choosers.  No one would dream of suing us for malpractice."

// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_COLLEAGUE_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2275885021" "I hear you."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_COLLEAGUE_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P4201819436" "Tell me about it."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_COLLEAGUE_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3230305851" "You got it."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_COLLEAGUE_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P486795360" "Absolutely."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_COLLEAGUE_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3553745229" "No kidding."

// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_PATIENT_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2781295867" "Just go home.  There's nothing I can do for you here."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_PATIENT_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2110112850" "Look, I think you need to reset your expectations.  This is not Paragon City."
// VILLAINS_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_PATIENT_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3847789354" "You're kind of talking like you're expecting me to really care here.  I have to say...they don't pay me enough for that."

// VILLAINS_DIGGING_CLIPBOARD_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3087591241" "This isn't right.  You guys sure you're digging in the right place?"
// VILLAINS_DIGGING_CLIPBOARD_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1588608102" "Whatever.  I don't care.  You're digging in the wrong spot.  Just make it look good."

// VILLAINS_DIGGING_DIGGER_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3832609468" "My...back...hurts."
// VILLAINS_DIGGING_DIGGER_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P4151514264" "I hate this.  I'd make more money mugging people."
// VILLAINS_DIGGING_DIGGER_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3346595160" "Just like digging for a body bag."

// VILLAINS_DIGGING_ARMSCROSSED_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3963960852" "Get to work.  I don't want to hear your excuses."
// VILLAINS_DIGGING_ARMSCROSSED_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1751541748" "Shut up.  Keep digging.  Pretend your life depends on it."
// VILLAINS_DIGGING_ARMSCROSSED_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2647037878" "Don't get smart.  If I pick up a shovel it'll be because I'm about to smash you over the head with it."

// VILLAINS_FLIPCOIN_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1509810305" "Heads, I take the job.  Tails I don't..."
// VILLAINS_FLIPCOIN_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P901112599" "Heads I ask her out.  Tails I ask her friend out..."
// VILLAINS_FLIPCOIN_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P4031417454" "Heads I stay.  Tails I head back to Paragon..."

// VILLAINS_NEWSPAPER_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2776939678" "Huh...so that's what he did."
// VILLAINS_NEWSPAPER_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2213790996" "Hm.  I'll have to let the boss know."
// VILLAINS_NEWSPAPER_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1813641009" "Well THAT is interesting."
// VILLAINS_NEWSPAPER_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1596057230" "Huh...Arachnos snagged a few more from the Zig.  Wild."
// VILLAINS_NEWSPAPER_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1403333670" "Hey, I know him."
// VILLAINS_NEWSPAPER_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1246569271" "Poor guy.  But...he had it coming."


// VILLAINS_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P812383155" "Whatever.  Is it stuck together?  That's all I care about."
// VILLAINS_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2533397163" "This is not rocket science.  I just need it to hold together long enough to pass inspection."
// VILLAINS_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3959094410" "You've been working on that piece for...what...two hours now?  You're going to weld it into nothing.  MOVE ON."

// VILLAINS_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P4190332540" "I'm the supervisor.  I don't weld."
// VILLAINS_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1914933070" "Just weld.  I don't want to hear your voice."
// VILLAINS_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P895983568" "Wrong.  That's wrong.  Fix it."
// VILLAINS_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1832121276" "Good enough.  Move on.  I don't care if you're not finished.  I said it was good enough."

// VILLAINS_WELDING_CELLPHONE_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2939959973" "Yeah, I'm still at work.  Hold on a sec, babe.  GET TO WORK.  Okay, I'm back."
// VILLAINS_WELDING_CELLPHONE_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3043359288" "Yeah, they work me like a dog here.  Lunch in 15?  Sure.  I can make it."

// VILLAINS_CONSTRUCTION_WHEELBARREL_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2811886913" "Better not be TNT in this pile like there was the last one.  I'm STILL waiting for my eyebrows to grow back."
// VILLAINS_CONSTRUCTION_WHEELBARREL_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3525145360" "I hate this job."
// VILLAINS_CONSTRUCTION_WHEELBARREL_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2404944893" "This is the worst job...ever."

