// GRANDVILLE_NPCCHECKPOINTQUEUE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3312740443" "Yeah.  I've been standing here for an HOUR.  I have no idea what's up.  Some kind of checkpoint."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCCHECKPOINTQUEUE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P170906634" "Seriously, don't come to Granville.  They got us penned up like cattle here."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCCHECKPOINTQUEUE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P900379261" "Artie, can't you do anything?  You're my lawyer for crying out loud!  What do I pay you for?  I KNOW you're pro bono!  Figure of speech!"

// GRANDVILLE_NPCIMMIGRATIONQUEUE_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P4079451670" "This is ridiculous.  We've been waiting here for over an hour."

// GRANDVILLE_NPCIMMIGRATIONQUEUE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P892684836" "Honey, I'm not going to be home anytime soon.  This whole immigration thing in Grandville is taking forever."

// VINDICATORS_JUSTICE_FORTRESS_SECURITYCHECKPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3601037968" "Enemy spotted! Red alert! Secure the control room immediately!"
// VINDICATORS_JUSTICE_FORTRESS_SECURITYCHECKPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3678569789" "Do not let anyone through!"
// VINDICATORS_JUSTICE_FORTRESS_SECURITYCHECKPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2606728236" "We're under attack! Activate base defenses immediately!"

// VINDICATORS_JUSTICE_FORTRESS_SECURITYCHECKPOINT2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3240406178" "Roger that, contacting the control room now!"
// VINDICATORS_JUSTICE_FORTRESS_SECURITYCHECKPOINT2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3440648364" "Affirmative!"
// VINDICATORS_JUSTICE_FORTRESS_SECURITYCHECKPOINT2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1958695534" "Acknowledged!"

// GRANDVILLE_NPCADMINISTRATIONLINEUP_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P2051270417" "Well, this isn't taking forever or anything."

// GRANDVILLE_NPCADMINISTRATIONLINEUP_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P824890680" "I'm still here.  Seriously."

// GRANDVILLE_LABCOATS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2901063" "Let's pick this up after lunch."

// GRANDVILLE_LABCOATS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P801847871" "Sounds good."

// GRANDVILLE_NPC_STATUETOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2048645373" "Oh how interesting.  I need a picture of this."

// GRANDVILLE_NPC_STATUETOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3312439854" "My cellphone doesn't have a camera on it.  You should SEE this statue.  It's cool."

// GRANDVILLE_NPC_STATUETOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P2967749389" "Lord Recluse...Rogue Isles...hmm...didn't know that part..."

// GRANDVILLE_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2695763555" "Oh.  Great shot.  Perfect."

// GRANDVILLE_NPC_TOURIST_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P395237289" "Yeah, I'm in Grandville.  It's not like anything you have ever seen."

// GRANDVILLE_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P955734771" "Eerily beautiful."

// GRANDVILLE_NPC_TERMINALCONFUSED_TEXT :
"P3450822547" "So...hey...is this an ATM or what?  It's not working."
// GRANDVILLE_NPC_TERMINALCONFUSED_TEXT :
"P2863385920" "I thought this was an ATM.  What is this?"

// GRANDVILLE_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1625757655" "If everyone could please quiet down.  PLEASE, people.  I'm about ready to begin."
// GRANDVILLE_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2967570556" "Quiet!  Honestly, people!  I'm on the pedestal!  You guys need to stop talking!  How am I supposed to speak if you're all talking?"
// GRANDVILLE_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P97639843" "This is IMPORTANT, people!  Shush!  I mean it!  Shush!  Do you want to know what's going on with their little 'experiments' gone wrong or not?"
// GRANDVILLE_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2094685643" "I'm not talking until you guys are quiet.  I'm just not."
// GRANDVILLE_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P502952697" "Okay, so you've lost your work visa for Spider City.  If you are interested in hearing my 12-point plan, I'll begin in just a few minutes."
// GRANDVILLE_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P238411823" "Pipe down!  The scans!  Did you see their scanning buildings now?  They're looking for 'them'!  The experiments!"
// GRANDVILLE_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2193830052" "I have walking maps and flying maps.  Having a hard time getting around the Tangle?  I'll be your guide!  For a small amount of Infamy..."

// GRANDVILLE_HOSPITAL_DOCTORS_TEXT :
"P614393953" "Right.  I'm thinking of specializing."
// GRANDVILLE_HOSPITAL_DOCTORS_TEXT :
"P366585649" "What's your take?  Think surgery is an option?"
// GRANDVILLE_HOSPITAL_DOCTORS_TEXT :
"P3758721190" "With all those soldiers dropping off the Tangle, I'm in constant short supply of splints and plaster."

// GRANDVILLE_NPCLOBBYLINEUP_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P445031830" "You're kidding me, right?  Wrong paperwork?"
// GRANDVILLE_NPCLOBBYLINEUP_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P4114420976" "No one said anything about that form.  No one."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCLOBBYLINEUP_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P490725935" "I'm going to miss my appointment."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCLOBBYLINEUP_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P264893584" "This is crazy.  I want to talk to your manager."

// GRANDVILLE_NPCLOBBYLINEUP_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1424183786" "I'm going to be a while.  I'm in Spider City."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCLOBBYLINEUP_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P409508744" "Hello?  Great.  Bad reception."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCLOBBYLINEUP_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2415382000" "Needless to say, I think I'm going to be late for dinner."

// GRANDVILLE_PORTAL_NPCSCANNER_TEXT :
"P3655122967" "Hm.  A little too low on the scale for my tastes."
// GRANDVILLE_PORTAL_NPCSCANNER_TEXT :
"P2513779544" "Looks good."
// GRANDVILLE_PORTAL_NPCSCANNER_TEXT :
"P2046391802" "Interesting."

// GRANDVILLE_PORTALTECH_CHATTER_A_TEXT :
"P322144131" "I have no idea when Arachnos is going to send us another test subject.  In fact, I don't think they've finished cleaning up the remains of the last one.  Very messy."
// GRANDVILLE_PORTALTECH_CHATTER_A_TEXT :
"P4109186034" "Make sure you tell Bill to attach the overthruster to the flux capacitor."
// GRANDVILLE_PORTALTECH_CHATTER_A_TEXT :
"P4048455704" "I'm not so certain these quantum mechanics will work out..."
// GRANDVILLE_PORTALTECH_CHATTER_A_TEXT :
"P1925891964" "The portals are a bit unstable.  We constantly need to make adjustments to keep them working properly."
// GRANDVILLE_PORTALTECH_CHATTER_A_TEXT :
"P3941357804" "Damn!  Another in the time/space continuum blew out the circuits again."
// GRANDVILLE_PORTALTECH_CHATTER_A_TEXT :
"P743178671" "Is Dr. Heisenburg here?   Well, he is and he isn't...?"

// GRANDVILLE_PORTALTECH_CHATTER_B_TEXT :
"P320272764" "Right."
// GRANDVILLE_PORTALTECH_CHATTER_B_TEXT :
"P2625332576" "You don't say."
// GRANDVILLE_PORTALTECH_CHATTER_B_TEXT :
"P1065466720" "I agree."

// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_TECHNICIANNPCSCANNER_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P972476742" "Well, scans appear normal.  You're probably a little woozy from the temporal shift."
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_TECHNICIANNPCSCANNER_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P313453199" "You'll be fine.  Not everyone can portal without having some dizziness."
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_TECHNICIANNPCSCANNER_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P75255000" "All scans appear normal.  You'll be fine.  Go back there and take over Recluse's Victory."
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_TECHNICIANNPCSCANNER_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P2668203024" "You're fine.  All scans are normal."

// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_STAGGERNPC_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P3109923917" "Just...a little...dizzy."
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_STAGGERNPC_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P2163438532" "Am I clear for transport?"
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_STAGGERNPC_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P45909262" "Just tell me the way to the portal.  What's it look like again?"
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_STAGGERNPC_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P375174704" "Whoa.  The world is...spinning."
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_STAGGERNPC_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P2187464750" "Are all my body parts in tact?"

// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_TECHNICIANNPCCLIPBOARD_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P4265818700" "I'm checking the list and looks like everything's fine.  You're a go as soon as you can stand steady."
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_TECHNICIANNPCCLIPBOARD_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P3557499256" "Blood pressure normal.  Check.  Heart rate normal.  Check.  You're good to go as soon as the light-headedness passes."

// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_TECHNICIANNPCARMSCROSSED_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P184338846" "You look fine to me.  Take some time to get your bearings."
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_TECHNICIANNPCARMSCROSSED_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P2907176877" "Ah, you're fine.  Take a few minutes to get your land legs back."
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_TECHNICIANNPCARMSCROSSED_WOOZY_VILLAIN_TEXT :
"P145183890" "All signs are normal.  The dizziness will pass."


// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_STAGGERNPCPATIENT_WOOZY_HERO_TEXT :
"P878312915" "Am I...clear for...transport?"
// GENERIC_PORTALROOM_STAGGERNPCPATIENT_WOOZY_HERO_TEXT :
"P1310189612" "Whoa...the world is spinning."



// GRANDVILLE_NPC_MAKO_ATTENDANT_BINOCULARS_TEXT :
"P475090123" "Everything looks good from here, sir."
// GRANDVILLE_NPC_MAKO_ATTENDANT_BINOCULARS_TEXT :
"P507148025" "The coast is clear, sir."
// GRANDVILLE_NPC_MAKO_ATTENDANT_BINOCULARS_TEXT :
"P430016948" "No activity to report, sir."

// GRANDVILLE_NPC_PITHERSLAWYER_BRIEFCASE_CHAT_TEXT :
"P343037418" "Don't answer that, sir."
// GRANDVILLE_NPC_PITHERSLAWYER_BRIEFCASE_CHAT_TEXT :
"P1022252601" "Say 'no comment.'"
// GRANDVILLE_NPC_PITHERSLAWYER_BRIEFCASE_CHAT_TEXT :
"P3781503793" "I wouldn't advise answering that, sir."

// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_CLUSTER_TEXT :
"P1386561572" "I bet those fancy buildings up in Spider City have some sweet dumpsters."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_CLUSTER_TEXT :
"P3490747354" "The Judge said 'The Army or the Rogue Isles...'  I sure chose wrong."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_CLUSTER_TEXT :
"P1298529078" "You think there is anything under Spider City? Sure looks like a lot of space under there."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_CLUSTER_TEXT :
"P243234800" "And the worst thing is that those Arachnoids actually think they're better than us!"
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_CLUSTER_TEXT :
"P180360462" "East Ward is going the way of North Ward.  Only a matter of time before Arachnos razes the entire place."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_CLUSTER_TEXT :
"P2595971384" "If you see one of them giant arachnos aircraft down here in the gutter run as fast you can! When they start 'cleaning' no one is safe."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_CLUSTER_TEXT :
"P893716674" "I applied to join Arachnos.  They turned me down when they found out I used to run with the Freakshow.  I still have all my limbs, too!"

// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_TEXT :
"P1400915483" "I used to work in one of the labs here.  We did awful things to those arachnoids."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_TEXT :
"P2083445847" "I am nervous as a cat, what with all these Arachnos exterminator squads."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_TEXT :
"P3998803458" "I got bit by a brown recluse once. So... Yeah, spiders freak me out."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_TEXT :
"P3533797000" "I'm so tired of all that constant speech of Lord Recluse's. 24 - 7 they play that loop."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_TEXT :
"P1300737868" "...and so there was a really bad sound from the front room and there were, like ... a hundred Arachnoids running around."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_TEXT :
"P2062113364" "I came to Grandville looking for work.  Apparently I'm 'undesirable,' yet they won't let me leave.  Where's the logic in that?"
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_TEXT :
"P1951662451" "Getting a work visa for Grandville is near impossible.  That's why so many of us get pushed down here."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCFIREBARREL_TEXT :
"P893437033" "I used to live in the North Ward... until Arachnos tried their 'Precision Infestation Mitigation and Abatement Program' on the Arachnoids that were hiding there. Don't let the 'Precision' fool you... It was a carpet bombing from the very beginning."

// GRANDVILLE_PANHANDLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1686560473" "I got pushed off the Spider City walls, and now I can't work no more."

// GRANDVILLE_NPCHAVENQUEUE_COFFEE_TEXT :
"P2841849049" "Westin Phipps is the greatest! He's a real hero!"
// GRANDVILLE_NPCHAVENQUEUE_COFFEE_TEXT :
"P3726174722" "I've seen Phipps go toe to toe with Arachnos before.  It's like they are afraid of him!"
// GRANDVILLE_NPCHAVENQUEUE_COFFEE_TEXT :
"P3958262366" "Haven House is a real saviour!."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCHAVENQUEUE_COFFEE_TEXT :
"P3429204643" "Hot meals and lessons from Phipps.  I love Haven House!"
// GRANDVILLE_NPCHAVENQUEUE_COFFEE_TEXT :
"P3011712728" "I'm so glad there is a place like haven House.  I'd be a goner for sure."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCHAVENQUEUE_COFFEE_TEXT :
"P2403924345" "Three cheers for westin Phipps! Arachnos is so totally afraid of him!"

// GRANDVILLE_NPCHAVENQUEUE_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P1958236932" "Haven House is the greatest!"
// GRANDVILLE_NPCHAVENQUEUE_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P1962597287" "We'd all be dead if it wasn't for Haven house."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCHAVENQUEUE_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P488775631" "Hope they are serving that wild rice and mushroom soup."
// GRANDVILLE_NPCHAVENQUEUE_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P3747317021" "When they denied me entry in to Spider City, I thought I was lost.  Haven House saved me!"



// GRANDVILLE_FERRY_ENTERGUARD_NPCARBITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1312465623" "Proceed to Customs.  You may not stop here."
// GRANDVILLE_FERRY_ENTERGUARD_NPCARBITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1237701611" "Keep moving on to Customs.  Do not stop."
// GRANDVILLE_FERRY_ENTERGUARD_NPCARBITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3155564360" "Keep moving.  Proceed to customs.  Do not stop."

// GRANDVILLE_FERRY_EXITGUARD_NPCARBITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3455066688" "Exit the landing.  You may not stay here."
// GRANDVILLE_FERRY_EXITGUARD_NPCARBITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P889930701" "Proceed directly to the ferry.  Do not stop."
// GRANDVILLE_FERRY_EXITGUARD_NPCARBITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4032596776" "Make your way to the ferry.  Do not stop."

// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2592201372" "I've been on this crew for a while now.  Long enough to get most of the concrete and beams in.  What about you?"
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3791327181" "I dunno what we're building, to be honest.  I just do what I'm told."
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2770910431" "I dunno.  We'll probably be working on this for a couple of months."

// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2278129176" "Yeah whatever.  I'm not wasting this sandwich.  If anyone's gonna try and whack me for a sandwich, he can pry it out of my cold dead hands."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1848954950" "Just ignore 'em.  You show fear they come after you."

// PORTOAKES_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P420219060" "Right.  Move it over there.  Like I just said."
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2721714601" "No no no!  Why are you walking that way!  That's not where it goes!"
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P502961462" "Four years of college and getting these guys to work right is like herding cats.  This is ridiculous."
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1930615254" "What?  No!  Not there!  Did I say there?  I didn't say there!  I distinctly remember NOT saying there!"
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P961650243" "Am I the ONLY one who knows what is going on here?"

// PORTOAKES_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3429302941" "Well maybe if you hadn't dawdled so much earlier you'd have time to run away from the nice villains.  Since you frittered it all away, keep moving crates!"
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P583645280" "Keep working.  The job doesn't end because The Family wanders in!"

// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3125729429" "Think they've noticed us sitting here for this long?"
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P4244916282" "I should probably get back to work.  Ten more minutes."
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2187685085" "I could go for a sandwich."
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P836867178" "I wonder how long this construction job will last.  My wife is pregnant with our third."
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P1040587461" "I don't know what we're building this for.  No one tells me anything."

// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P258886240" "Shh.  Don't move.  If anything goes down, they'll go for the weak ones first."
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1499787295" "Whatever.  I'm on break.  The Family will go after the runners first anyway."
// PORTOAKES_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3589008686" "I wonder if they see us.  Let's just sit here quietly and maybe they'll go away."

// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P738434808" "Why don't we just skip class and go out to lunch?"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P768834245" "So I said, 'look, pal, I don't care if you copy off my paper, but it's gonna cost ya'."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3385575860" "Why are these guys so immature?  I ask you.  Why?"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3847485950" "Mr. Bright is kinda hot in a lunatic kind of way."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3861997108" "He said something I didn't like, so I broke his arm.  I'm not seeing that as aggressive.  Think he'll still go out with me?  He DID say he liked strong women."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3126062433" "I thought college would be fun.  But they make you do work.  I feel so cheated."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3397953183" "I saw the cutest boy in the the library today.  Soooo cute.  I love college."

// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P2885587092" "Hee hee."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P1131332828" "No kidding!"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P3539052874" "I believe it!"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P402824053" "Wow!"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P2572338600" "I have no response to that."

// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1985834179" "You WHAT my car?  Are you kidding me?!  You are SO paying for the new bumper!"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P22182072" "Nah, it's all good.  They don't even care if we show up.  I'll still pass."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P428827322" "Sure.  What about that place down the street?  Yeah, I'll meet you there."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2112154116" "Would you stop screaming at me, I'm a quiet zone!"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3615465471" "I have a lab in about twenty minutes.  But I can talk to you for two hours.  Of course I can.  I have unlimited minutes."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3394055858" "What do you mean it's not covered under warranty?  I can't help that I threw it at a bee.  It was going to STING me and now it doesn't even work properly!"

// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_PARKBENCH_SNOOZING_WAKEUP_TEXT :
"P3613067772" "Get your own bench."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_PARKBENCH_SNOOZING_WAKEUP_TEXT :
"P1751059943" "Beat it."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_PARKBENCH_SNOOZING_WAKEUP_TEXT :
"P376354892" "I was snoozing here."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_PARKBENCH_SNOOZING_WAKEUP_TEXT :
"P1245539037" "THANKS for waking me up.  Soooooo appreciate it.  Yes that's sarcasm."

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P3783380596" "Well...I'll see what I can do.  For the right price."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P2361651778" "Sure, it's okay that you missed five days in a row.  You know it's gonna cost extra, right?"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P2017207339" "Lemme think on that.  For the right price, I'm sure we can come up with an equitable agreement."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P1133925360" "I'm a can-do instructor.  I can do that for you.  If you pay me the appropriate amount of money."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P4010663777" "This is a place of higher learning.  You need to learn who is higher on the food chain.  And that would be me."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P571911506" "I'm reasonable.  Everyone says so.  So, reasonably, how quickly can you get me that third installment?"

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P3861876312" "Er...well, okay."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P3612684350" "Well, I..."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P267242952" "Uh...alright."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P2558957195" "Okay, not exactly the response I thought I'd get but..."

// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_BUM_SLUMP_NOT_MOVING_TEXT :
"P3868840114" "Beat it, chump."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_BUM_SLUMP_NOT_MOVING_TEXT :
"P858568539" "Sleeping here."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_BUM_SLUMP_NOT_MOVING_TEXT :
"P2433645542" "My garbage.  Get your own garbage."

// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P865593553" "Could you people BE any more incompetent?"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P1592462305" "I think they're ignoring us.  This is so dumb."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P3629127058" "Taking too long here...waiting wayyyy too long."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P4277933018" "I just grew an age spot."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P868905921" "74.  That is how many times I have counted to 100.  This is ridiculous.  This line isn't even moving!"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P1488993050" "I feel like I've been standing beside this nitwit for an hour.  Oh.  Sorry.  I said that aloud."

// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P1617579640" "Sure, it's okay you missed five days in a row.  You know it's gonna cost extra, right?"

// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P1252006326" "So yeah...sorry about missing that assignment.  Think you can cut me a break?"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P1119186162" "Okay, not exactly the response I thought I'd get but...how much you need?"

// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_SELL_TERMPAPER_TEXT :
"P177940187" "Psst.  Wanna buy a term paper?  Cheap."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_SELL_TERMPAPER_TEXT :
"P2431701283" "I got what you need.  Term Papers for all classes.  Cheapest prices around."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_SELL_TERMPAPER_TEXT :
"P2513688317" "If you're not buying your term paper from me, you're paying too much."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_SELL_TERMPAPER_TEXT :
"P3678793874" "You could study.  Or...you could just buy one of my term papers.  Super cheap."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_SELL_TERMPAPER_TEXT :
"P4289500720" "Term papers for all classes.  100% guaranteed to be not completely wrong this time."

// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_RECRUITER_TEXT :
"P3914169178" "What'll it be?  Freakshow?  Arachnos?  Luddites?  I got contacts.  All over."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_RECRUITER_TEXT :
"P3347114556" "I'll be here all week.  Feel free to come and speak to me about your future in the villain industry.  Many groups are represented within my company:  Carnival, Crey, you name it."
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_RECRUITER_TEXT :
"P1488686751" "Are you interested in a dastardly career with Arachnos?  Or how about a slightly lunatic one with Freakshow?  I have all the information you need.  Villain Recruitment International is your one-stop shop for career options!"
// VILLAIN_UNIVERSITY_RECRUITER_TEXT :
"P1740170542" "You look like you'll make an excellent villain, but there are so many choices.  Do you know what you want?  Go it alone?  Or join an established organization?  Questions like these will be answered at my recruiting seminar later this afternoon in the Library."

